    "description": "Twelve-tab Portfolio Intelligence terminal. It starts on a sample (demo) account and sample data until you connect your own. Research tabs F1-F7 follow the symbol in Group 1; portfolio tabs F8-F11 and Morning Review follow the account in Group 2. Every tab shows where its data comes from and whether the data providers are healthy. The suggested prompts walk a ten-step weekly review: provider health and company profile, financials, sector X-Ray, risk and attribution, upcoming events, alerts, paper trading, the morning review and analyst views of a sample basket.",
